            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your companion can let out a howl laced with your primal magic. It gains the following advanced maneuver, in addition to any advanced maneuvers it already knows.\n\n**Primal Howl [2 actions]**\nYour familiar screeches and howls, empowered with natural magic. All creatures in a 30-foot cone take 1d6 sonic damage for every 2 levels your companion has, with a basic Fortitude save against your spell DC. Creatures that fail become frightened 1, and creatures that critically fail become frightened 2. The fright is an emotion, fear, and mental effect."
            }
          }
        }
